# Always build installable after changes

After completing any functional change to the RMA System (UI, services, models, migrations, config used at runtime):

1. Bump `#define AppVersion` in `setup.iss` (patch: 1.3.x → next).
2. Stop running `RMASystem.exe` / unlock `publish\` if needed.
3. Run `build-installer.ps1` from the solution root.
4. Confirm `Output\RMA_System_v{version}_Setup.exe` exists and report that path to the user.

Do this without waiting to be asked. Skip only for pure docs/rules with no app code change.
